  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1802.25 “Resident” means “resident” as defined in RSA 21:6.\n\nSource. #8405, eff 8-2-05 (formerly Saf-C 1801.21); ss by #10523, eff 2-18-14, EXPIRED: 2-18-24\n\nNew. #13963, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 5-13-24; ss by #14100, eff 10-18-24, EXPIRES: 10-18-34",
